[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24420.468, "timestamp": "06:47:00", "text": "ba。えっと、そうですね、服を着させてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24421.868, "timestamp": "06:47:01", "text": "本物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24423.468, "timestamp": "06:47:03", "text": "素早い。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24427.35, "timestamp": "06:47:07", "text": "えーと、それで、本当に時間が足りなかったんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24429.91, "timestamp": "06:47:09", "text": "昨日。私はとても遅くまで寝ていました。私は私だった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24432.19, "timestamp": "06:47:12", "text": "やらなければならないことがあった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24434.788, "timestamp": "06:47:14", "text": "荷物、全部詰めるよ。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24437.39, "timestamp": "06:47:17", "text": "今日出発するけど、まだ終わってない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24438.99, "timestamp": "06:47:18", "text": "パッキング。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24442.948, "timestamp": "06:47:22", "text": "ええ、そうですね。だから、小川の後の午後、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24446.07, "timestamp": "06:47:26", "text": "準備に取り掛かります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24447.51, "timestamp": "06:47:27", "text": "もの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24451.03, "timestamp": "06:47:31", "text": "えーと、試験会場は、えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24452.708, "timestamp": "06:47:32", "text": "本当に厳しいので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24455.43, "timestamp": "06:47:35", "text": "私の携帯電話などを持って行かない方がいい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24457.948, "timestamp": "06:47:37", "text": "世の中には色々なものがある。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24461.99, "timestamp": "06:47:41", "text": "ええと、そうですね、本当にたくさんあります。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24463.31, "timestamp": "06:47:43", "text": "それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24467.35, "timestamp": "06:47:47", "text": "だから、それが一種の痛みなんです。また、"}]